# From the Deep

In this problem, you'll write freeform responses to the questions provided in the specification.

## Random Partitioning

In this way, only one boat won't be overloaded with data, but on the other hand, querying could be harder than having everything in one place; nevertheless, a view grouping all boats could easily solve this problem.

## Partitioning by Hour

On this approach, data will be stored partitioned by hours, leaving some boats without observation if in a given hour there are 0 observations. On the other hand, querying will be easy considering hours as a filter.

## Partitioning by Hash Value

This last proposal is similar to the first one,  adding the challenge of creating the function, and keeping the problem of querying in all boats.
